sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant AEP as ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant OOH as OrderOutboxHandler
    participant OOR as OrderOutboxRepository
    participant OEP as OrderEventPublisher
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker
    participant OEC as OrderEventConsumer
    participant Scheduler as OrderScheduler

    %% 주문 확정 플로우
    Client->>OS: confirm(orderId)
    OS->>OS: order.confirm()
    OS->>AEP: publishEvent(OrderEvent.Completed)

    %% 트랜잭션 커밋 전 - 아웃박스 저장
    AEP->>OOH: @TransactionalEventListener(BEFORE_COMMIT)<br/>saveToOutbox(event)
    OOH->>OOR: save(event)

    Note over OS: 트랜잭션 커밋

    %% 트랜잭션 커밋 후 - 카프카 발행
    AEP->>OOH: @TransactionalEventListener(AFTER_COMMIT)<br/>handleOrderCompletedEvent(event)
    OOH->>OEP: publish("order-completed", event)
    OEP->>Kafka: send(topic, message)

    %% 자기 자신이 소비
    Kafka->>OEC: @KafkaListener("order-completed")
    OEC->>OOR: findByOrderId(orderId).published()

    OS->>Client: OrderInfo 반환

    %% 스케줄러 - 실패한 이벤트 재발행
    Note over Scheduler: 60초마다 실행
    Scheduler->>OOR: findUnpublishedEvents("Completed")
    loop 미발행 이벤트들
        Scheduler->>OEP: publish("order-completed", payload)
        OEP->>Kafka: send(topic, message)
        alt 발행 실패시
            Scheduler->>Scheduler: incrementRetryCount()
            Scheduler->>OOR: saveAll(failedEvents)
        end
    end